    <string name="wear_desc_cl800">CL800 is a dual mode heart rate chest strap which can support BLE and ANT+.It uses ECG to detect heart rate signals, accurately measuring the real-time heart rate,and monitoring HRV data.</string>
    <string name="wear_desc_cl820">CL820W is a tri- mode wireless charger heart rate chest strap which can support BLE, ANT+ and 5.3k . It uses ECG to detect heart rate signals, accurately measuring the real-time heart rate, and monitoring HRV data. Work with a variety of application software for data collection and analysis applications.</string>
    <string name="wear_desc_cl830">CL830 is a dual mode optical armband heart rate monitor which can support BLE and ANT+ , and give you accurate heart rate and calorie burn data for up to 60 hours.</string>
    <string name="wear_desc_cl880">CL880 is a multi-function sports wristband . It uses advanced optical sensor to detect the heart rate,meanwhile, it tracks daily activity amount including steps, calories, distance, sleep qualities. It also has reminder settings like break reminder, incoming calls reminder and message reminder, these settings could be download to the device and work. Plenty of applications like camera control, music control, and anti-lost function.</string>
